  (text "SECTION 1: POWER ENTRY & REVERSE POLARITY PROTECTION\n- Input: 3S LiPo via XT30-PW (11.1V - 12.6V)\n- Fuse: F1 (PPTC 1812 3A 30V Resettable)\n- Reverse Polarity: Q1 (AO3401A P-MOSFET, -30V, 45mOhm)\n- Gate Clamping: D2 (15V Zener) + R1 (100k Pulldown)\n- Bulk Motor Buffering: C1 (100uF 25V Low-ESR Electrolytic)"
    (at 25.4 30.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "t-sec1")
  )

  (text "SECTION 2: STEP-DOWN REGULATION (5V BUCK & 3.3V LDO)\n- 5.0V Buck: TPS54302 (SOT-23-6, 3A, 400kHz, C96570)\n  L1: 4.7uH Shielded (4.5A, C168341), C4/C5: 2x 22uF 10V X7R\n  Feedback: R2 (100k 1%) & R3 (13.7k 1%) -> 4.95V\n- 3.3V LDO: AP2112K-3.3 (SOT-23-5, 600mA, C21344)\n  Powers MCU VDD/VDDA, Analog Pullups, and Logic\n  Decoupling: C6/C7 (4.7uF 10V X7R) + C9 (100nF)"
    (at 125.0 30.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "t-sec2")
  )

  (text "SECTION 3: 3S LIPO VOLTAGE DIVIDER MONITOR\n- Top Resistor: R4 (100k 1% 0603, C25804)\n- Bottom Resistor: R5 (22k 1% 0603, C25768)\n- Filter Cap: C10 (100nF 16V 0603, C14663)\n- Output: PA4 (ADC1_IN4). Ratio = 22/(100+22) = 0.180327\n  12.6V -> 2.27V, 9.9V -> 1.78V, 9.3V -> 1.68V"
    (at 25.4 65.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "t-sec3")
  )

  (text "SECTION 4: TB6612FNG MOTOR DRIVER (SSOP-24 BARE-IC)\n- VM: Fused +12V_BAT with 100uF Bulk + 10uF + 100nF Local Ceramic\n- VCC: 3.3V Logic Rail\n- STBY (Pin 19): HARDWIRED DIRECTLY TO 3.3V PLANE (0 GPIOs wasted!)\n- Left Motor: TIM2_CH1 (PA0 @ 20kHz), AIN1 (PC8), AIN2 (PC9)\n- Right Motor: TIM2_CH2 (PA1 @ 20kHz), BIN1 (PC11), BIN2 (PC12)\n- Motor Connectors: J4 & J5 (JST-PH 6-Pin: M+, M-, 5V, GND, Enc_A, Enc_B)"
    (at 125.0 65.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "t-sec4")
  )

  (text "SECTION 5: MCU CORE (STM32F446RET6 LQFP-64)\n- Crystal: 8.000 MHz 3225 (Y1) + 2x 18pF C0G (C11, C12) -> 180 MHz PLL\n- Decoupling: 4x 100nF at VDD pins, 4.7uF bulk (C17)\n- Core VCAP: 2x 2.2uF 10V Low-ESR (C18, C19 on pins 30/47)\n- Analog VDDA: FB1 (600 Ohm Ferrite Bead) + 100nF + 1uF Low-Pass Filter\n- SWD Programming: 4-Pin Header (3.3V, SWDIO PA13, SWCLK PA14, GND)\n- Bootloader: BOOT0 with 10k pulldown & 3-pin jumper"
    (at 25.4 150.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "t-sec5")
  )

  (text "SECTION 6: PERIPHERAL HEADERS & DRIVERS\n- HC-05 Socket: 6-Pin 2.54mm Header (5V, GND, PA9 TXD, PA10 RXD, PB2 STATE)\n- Active Buzzer: 5V Transducer + S8050 NPN (Q3) + 1k Base (R10) on PB8\n- Status LED: Green 0603 (D3) + 1k (R7) on PA5\n- User Button: Tactile Switch (SW_USER) + 10k Pullup on PC13\n- Sensor Blade Ribbon: 10-Pin 2.0mm Header (3.3V, GND, S1-S8 Analog, PB14 Gate)"
    (at 125.0 150.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "t-sec6")
  )
)
